#STUDY
ST:STUDY_TITLE                   	Relative quantification of lactic acid secreted in media from cell lines treated
ST:STUDY_TITLE                   	with or without Antimycin A.
ST:STUDY_SUMMARY                 	This study aimed to investigate the lactate secretion as a measurement of
ST:STUDY_SUMMARY                 	glycolytic switch in subjected cell lines during OXPHOS dysfunction using
ST:STUDY_SUMMARY                 	targeted GC-MS analysis.
